585
00:33:57,880 --> 00:34:00,530
to the marriage

586
00:34:02,590 --> 00:34:03,570
between Ao Yi and Jiang Si'er, right?

587
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:08,690
Good.

588
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:10,300
Three days later,

589
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:13,050
we'll hold the wedding ceremony.

590
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:16,050
Turtle Minister, hurry and prepare.

591
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:16,900
Yes.

592
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:19,130
Congratulations, Dragon King.

593
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:31,300
Attendant.

594
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:32,420
The jug is empty.

595
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:33,300
Bring another jug.

596
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:52,300
I showed him mercy today,

597
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:54,210
but he fought me to the death.

598
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,900
If he weren't my brother,

599
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:57,300
I wouldn't have lost.

600
00:34:57,670 --> 00:35:00,050
Indeed, the First Prince held back.

601
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:01,860
Little Prince is being unreasonable.

602
00:35:02,230 --> 00:35:02,900
Right.

603
00:35:04,150 --> 00:35:04,980
Golden dragon.

604
00:35:07,190 --> 00:35:08,340
The golden dragon we encountered

605
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,340
in the South Sea that day

606
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:12,780
was actually Ao Yi.

607
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,490
You were sneak-attacked then,

608
00:35:14,510 --> 00:35:15,570
unrecovered from severe wounds,

609
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,260
that's why Little Prince

610
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,740
had a chance today.

611
00:35:20,590 --> 00:35:22,260
Have you ever considered

612
00:35:22,710 --> 00:35:24,210
that the South Sea matter

613
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,780
was also a scheme?

614
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:29,860
Ao Yi is my brother.

615
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:31,420
What scheme could there be?

616
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:33,690
If that golden dragon was his true form,

617
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:35,860
why didn't he reveal himself to you

618
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:38,900
when you were in the South Sea?

619
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:41,380
Well, maybe it's because...

620
00:35:48,710 --> 00:35:49,490
Right.

621
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:52,460
Ever since Changgeng appeared,

622
00:35:53,670 --> 00:35:56,170
the Little Prince
has stopped obeying you.

623
00:35:56,550 --> 00:35:59,260
He left the East Sea
without permission to train,

624
00:35:59,550 --> 00:36:02,570
transformed into a dragon
and attacked you, leaving you wounded.

625
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:05,610
And now, while you're still recovering,

626
00:36:06,590 --> 00:36:08,090
he defeated you in front of everyone.

627
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,090
Right.

628
00:36:12,190 --> 00:36:13,010
A scheme.

629
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:17,980
He had long coveted your place.

630
00:36:19,070 --> 00:36:20,900
So he joined forces with Changgeng

631
00:36:21,510 --> 00:36:22,980
to take what you love

632
00:36:23,630 --> 00:36:25,130
and wound your spirit.

633
00:36:25,670 --> 00:36:27,460
He is no longer your brother.

634
00:36:28,670 --> 00:36:29,530
He is

635
00:36:30,230 --> 00:36:31,820
your enemy.

636
00:36:33,190 --> 00:36:33,940
Right.

637
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:37,420
Right.

638
00:36:38,280 --> 00:36:39,010
Ao Yi

639
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,820
is my enemy.

640
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,380
Ao Yi

641
00:36:47,030 --> 00:36:47,860
is my...

642
00:36:54,190 --> 00:36:55,530
You'll always be my brother.

643
00:36:56,230 --> 00:36:57,690
Join me in restoring the Dragon Clan.

644
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:58,740
Alright?

645
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,340
No.

646
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:13,260
Ao Yi is not my enemy.

647
00:37:17,190 --> 00:37:19,010
Ao Yi is my brother.

648
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:26,050
First Prince, you've worked hard today.

649
00:37:27,150 --> 00:37:28,420
Get some rest.

650
00:37:32,630 --> 00:37:33,740
Master Jin Chan.

651
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:35,420
You...

652
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:41,010
This pawn is useless now.

653
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:43,300
Take him to the East Palace.

654
00:37:44,510 --> 00:37:47,530
Lock him in his room and keep him there.

655
00:37:48,110 --> 00:37:49,490
Master, you mean,

656
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:51,530
confine the First Prince?

657
00:37:51,710 --> 00:37:53,490
Killing him is too much trouble.

658
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,900
Well played, Changgeng.

659
00:37:59,110 --> 00:38:02,130
He ruined a pawn of mine.

660
00:38:03,710 --> 00:38:06,090
Your victory today

661
00:38:06,110 --> 00:38:09,300
is absolutely crucial. Congratulations.

662
00:38:09,630 --> 00:38:12,170
Did I hurt my brother?

663
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:14,690
You brothers

664
00:38:14,710 --> 00:38:17,380
will have plenty of time
to mend the bonds later.

665
00:38:17,400 --> 00:38:18,260
Right now, we must

666
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:20,940
make good use of this victory.

667
00:38:21,110 --> 00:38:23,210
But I never meant to hurt him.

668
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:32,170
Our actions this time

669
00:38:32,190 --> 00:38:34,300
concern the safety of the Dragon Clan

670
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:36,860
and even the safety of the Three Realms.

671
00:38:38,630 --> 00:38:40,210
Is there truly no other way?

672
00:38:41,550 --> 00:38:43,010
Must I beat my brother?

673
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,300
In today's battle,

674
00:38:45,630 --> 00:38:47,420
if you hadn't given it your all,

675
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,610
you would've been hurt by him.

676
00:38:49,150 --> 00:38:50,170
On the battlefield, that's the rule.

677
00:38:50,840 --> 00:38:52,860
You either strike first,
or you get struck down.

678
00:38:53,590 --> 00:38:54,380
Your Highness.

679
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:57,090
The strength and wisdom
you've shown today

680
00:38:57,510 --> 00:38:59,300
are nothing like the person I first met.

681
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:01,900
You've changed completely.

682
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,210
If Changgeng could see

683
00:39:03,320 --> 00:39:05,010
how much you've changed,

684
00:39:05,710 --> 00:39:07,090
he'd surely be happy for you.

685
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:15,690
Right.

686
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:18,300
I owe it all to the armor you gave me.

687
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:19,780
What?

688
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:20,780
I mean...

689
00:39:22,030 --> 00:39:23,570
This armor. You gave it to me.

690
00:39:24,710 --> 00:39:25,530
I did?

691
00:39:26,550 --> 00:39:28,050
That day, the maids
brought me some clothes.

692
00:39:28,070 --> 00:39:29,780
Hidden within them
was an armor sealed by power.

693
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:32,210
Their cultivation was too weak
to see through it.

694
00:39:32,590 --> 00:39:33,780
They thought it was ordinary clothes

695
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:34,690
and gave it to me.

696
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:37,860
Did I?

697
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:39,610
I must say, you human disciple

698
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:41,490
are remarkably considerate.

699
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,740
Thanks to your suit of armor,

700
00:39:43,030 --> 00:39:45,090
he would've been hurt today otherwise.

701
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:46,860
This armor is a rare treasure indeed.

702
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:47,900
Invulnerable to weapons.

703
00:39:48,070 --> 00:39:49,460
And you kept this from us?

704
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,260
Playing it so safe.

705
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:51,610
When that dragon

706
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:53,380
had you pinned down,

707
00:39:53,510 --> 00:39:54,980
he was the one

708
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:56,300
who told me to call out to you

709
00:39:56,510 --> 00:39:57,690
and tell you
to transform and fight back.

710
00:39:58,550 --> 00:39:59,900
Did I say that?

711
00:40:33,050 --> 00:40:38,830
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

712
00:40:39,500 --> 00:40:46,200
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

713
00:40:47,730 --> 00:40:53,780
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

714
00:40:54,410 --> 00:41:00,860
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

715
00:41:01,600 --> 00:41:08,720
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

716
00:41:09,100 --> 00:41:16,000
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

717
00:41:16,380 --> 00:41:23,730
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

718
00:41:23,730 --> 00:41:30,900
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

719
00:41:47,040 --> 00:41:52,210
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

720
00:41:53,300 --> 00:42:00,320
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

721
00:42:01,510 --> 00:42:07,450
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

722
00:42:08,150 --> 00:42:15,230
♪Alas, our story is short♪

723
00:42:15,570 --> 00:42:22,680
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

724
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:29,480
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

725
00:42:30,260 --> 00:42:37,470
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

726
00:42:37,860 --> 00:42:45,680
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
